      "speaker": null,
      "text": "而成為真正的人工智能強國",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "index": 96,
      "start_ms": 247400,
      "end_ms": 250400,
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "中國還認重到遠",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "index": 97,
      "start_ms": 250400,
      "end_ms": 255400,
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "中國在論文總量和高貝予論文數量向都排在世界第一",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "index": 98,
      "start_ms": 255400,
      "end_ms": 261400,
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "但中國在人才總量以及接觸人才的戰比都偏低",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "index": 99,
      "start_ms": 261400,
      "end_ms": 264400,
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "中國科學院裡的意願是指出",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "index": 100,
      "start_ms": 264400,
      "end_ms": 267400,
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "中國只能產業還處在運喻階段",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "index": 101,
      "start_ms": 267400,
      "end_ms": 270400,
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "產業爆發期遠遠沒有到來",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "index": 102,
      "start_ms": 270400,
      "end_ms": 272400,
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "然後解職到2017年10月",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "index": 103,
      "start_ms": 272400,
      "end_ms": 276400,
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "中國人工只能人才缺口是少在100萬以上",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "index": 104,
      "start_ms": 276400,
      "end_ms": 286300,
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "2017年前十個月內,人工智能人才需求量已經達到2016年的盡量倍,2015年的5.3倍",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "index": 105,
      "start_ms": 286300,
      "end_ms": 297300,
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "作為國家的整體規劃來說,對人工智能的人才需求破淺,人工智能發展,從一開始就令人類洗優餐板",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "index": 106,
      "start_ms": 297300,
      "end_ms": 304300,
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "他帶給我們全新的體驗之餘,同時也一直是我們焦慮和恐懼的所在",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "index": 107,
      "start_ms": 304300,
      "end_ms": 310820,
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "早期,人類最害怕的是,機器人起兵造反,將人類殺個騙家不流",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "index": 108,
      "start_ms": 310820,
      "end_ms": 315360,
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "而到了如今,我們又害怕比機器人所取代",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "index": 109,
      "start_ms": 315360,
      "end_ms": 318080,
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "而且這些都不是空秀來風",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "index": 110,
      "start_ms": 318080,
      "end_ms": 325200,
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "據英國 BBC統計,未來十年,人工智能將於8%以上的概力取代",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "index": 111,
      "start_ms": 325200,
      "end_ms": 332040,
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "快劑,銀行職員,政府職員,保安、司機、等職業",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "index": 112,
      "start_ms": 332040,
      "end_ms": 334440,
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "而微軟小兵的出現",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "index": 113,
      "start_ms": 334440,
      "end_ms": 335800,
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "也讓我們看到了",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "index": 114,
      "start_ms": 335800,
      "end_ms": 337440,
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "機器人也可以成為事人",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "index": 115,
      "start_ms": 337440,
      "end_ms": 339720,
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "這間數據",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "index": 116,
      "start_ms": 339720,
      "end_ms": 341160,
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "另每個行業的人們",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "index": 117,
      "start_ms": 341160,
      "end_ms": 342320,
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "都感到優興",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "index": 118,
      "start_ms": 342320,
      "end_ms": 345320,
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "正能化的時代正在開啟",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "index": 119,
      "start_ms": 345320,
      "end_ms": 347160,
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "又來又多的人",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "index": 120,
      "start_ms": 347160,
      "end_ms": 348840,
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "會被捲入這股浪場中",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "index": 121,
      "start_ms": 348840,
      "end_ms": 351880,
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "無論是作為旁觀者",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "index": 122,
      "start_ms": 351880,
      "end_ms": 352920,
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "還是弄長而",
      "translation": null
    },
